# AI-Assisted Software Engineering Governance

A practical governance model for AI-assisted software development.

It guides AI agents to preserve context, trace user flows, identify root causes, make correct-layer repairs, and verify changes.

**Usage:** 

Copy the governance document into your project and configure your AI coding agent to follow it. 

It can also be adapted into a project Constitution or split into reusable Agent Skills.

**Version:** 1.0
